    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d260">

                <pb facs="0387" n="215" xml:id="pg215"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111M72/8</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Willard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-26T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 26, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>435. Your 481, April 16, 10 a.m. Request Foreign Office to instruct Berlin
                    immediately to visit camps where <hi rendition="#italic">Moewe</hi> prisoners
                    interned and report fully by telegraph. Department should be informed of their
                    names, where interned, their physical condition, and amount of food and clothing
                    furnished them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
